WEBVTT

01:09.069 --> 01:10.570
BASED ON WEBTOON TRUE BEAUTY
BY YAONGYI

01:49.734 --> 01:51.986
Hey, I heard Lim Ju-kyung
came to school without makeup on.

01:52.070 --> 01:54.489
Do you really think
she's dating Lee Soo-ho?

01:54.572 --> 01:56.574
I saw her face earlier
and it was worse than the pictures.

01:56.658 --> 01:58.409
They would've broken up by now.

01:58.493 --> 01:59.786
How could he date her
after seeing that face?

01:59.869 --> 02:02.288
Isn't he also lame lately?
His dad is a has-been.

02:02.372 --> 02:04.874
I guess he's just out of his mind
and dating anyone now.

02:04.958 --> 02:06.960
- Gosh, that was harsh.
- What?

02:07.043 --> 02:08.503
- Let's go.
- Sure, let's!

02:08.586 --> 02:10.755
- Hey, what's that?
- Hey.

02:18.263 --> 02:19.639
Hey, you!

02:20.890 --> 02:23.226
- Take back what you just said.
- Lim Ju-kyung?

02:24.102 --> 02:26.980
Hey, are you crazy,
going around without makeup on?

02:27.063 --> 02:29.482
Yes. I'm dating Lee Soo-ho.

02:29.566 --> 02:31.776
Lee Soo-ho is my boyfriend!

02:31.860 --> 02:33.695
Happy? Did that satisfy your curiosity?

02:33.778 --> 02:36.030
- She must have gone crazy.
- Right?

02:36.114 --> 02:39.367
He doesn't judge people by their looks,

02:39.450 --> 02:42.370
and he likes me for who I am,
no matter what I look like.

02:42.453 --> 02:44.956
He's a way better person
than you mean and awful people.

02:45.039 --> 02:47.876
So don't talk behind his back
and put him down for dating me.

02:47.959 --> 02:49.836
Say it all straight to my face!

02:49.919 --> 02:51.546
I'll take you all down. Got it?

02:51.629 --> 02:53.840
And if you have time
to judge others' looks,

02:53.923 --> 02:55.466
try studying instead!

02:56.092 --> 02:56.968
Step aside!

03:04.017 --> 03:05.393
Are they really dating?

03:08.688 --> 03:09.522
I'm so jealous.

03:51.606 --> 03:52.941
Let's go.

04:04.994 --> 04:06.079
Hey, you're here.

04:06.162 --> 04:07.330
What should we eat later?

04:07.413 --> 04:10.041
- Tteokbokki.
- I know a great tteokbokki place.

04:10.124 --> 04:11.459
Really? Shall we go there?

04:11.542 --> 04:14.128
A boyfriend? Of course, I don't.

04:32.772 --> 04:35.191
Gosh, your car's pretty nice.

04:35.900 --> 04:37.568
- I guess you're doing well.
- Do you like it?

04:37.652 --> 04:38.611
Yes.

04:39.362 --> 04:40.363
Do you want it?

04:43.658 --> 04:44.492
That's cute.

04:47.578 --> 04:49.580
You can be my grapefruit from now on.

04:56.129 --> 04:57.922
- But I'm the grapefruit!
- Goodness!

04:59.549 --> 05:01.217
Goodness, my heart…

05:01.301 --> 05:02.760
I'd love some grapefruit.

05:04.721 --> 05:06.973
I just really love grapefruit, you know.

05:13.730 --> 05:15.940
- Are they really dating?
- I'm so jealous.

05:18.192 --> 05:19.986
That's the end of our dating in secret.

05:21.195 --> 05:22.030
Yes.

05:22.739 --> 05:25.992
I came clean about both my bare face
and our relationship today.

05:27.118 --> 05:27.952
Are you all right?

05:28.745 --> 05:29.704
No.

05:30.413 --> 05:32.457
I'm as nervous as I can be.

05:33.249 --> 05:35.501
Why didn't you come as you usually do?

05:36.919 --> 05:39.422
Go-un said this to me once.

05:41.090 --> 05:43.009
If I started hating my face

05:43.092 --> 05:44.844
because of others' rude comments,

05:44.927 --> 05:47.472
I'd be accepting it as a fact
that I'm ugly.

05:49.432 --> 05:50.600
So moving forward,

05:51.559 --> 05:54.187
I'm only going to listen
to the people who love me.

05:55.313 --> 05:58.066
Words spat out by people who don't know me

05:58.858 --> 06:00.151
are not worth my attention.

06:01.194 --> 06:03.404
I'm not going to run or hide anymore.

06:03.488 --> 06:04.989
That's why I didn't wear makeup.

06:06.574 --> 06:08.242
You've grown so much, Ju-kyung.

06:11.788 --> 06:12.789
Hey, Mom.

06:12.872 --> 06:15.333
She's all right.
She has her savior by her side too.

06:15.416 --> 06:17.210
What? What savior?

06:17.293 --> 06:19.712
- No need to worry.
- No one's bothering her?

06:19.796 --> 06:21.547
So I don't need to show up?

06:22.131 --> 06:22.965
All right.

06:23.633 --> 06:25.051
Is Ju-kyung doing all right?

06:25.635 --> 06:27.428
He says she's doing okay,

06:27.512 --> 06:29.514
but we can't know
how she's actually feeling.

06:29.597 --> 06:31.933
I'm sure she's fine. She's your daughter.

06:37.105 --> 06:37.939
Why are you here?

06:39.148 --> 06:39.982
Go!

06:43.820 --> 06:45.238
- Go away!
- What the heck?

06:46.322 --> 06:47.949
- Why is he…
- Goodness.

06:48.032 --> 06:50.034
- What is this?
- Don't stir up my heart!

06:50.118 --> 06:50.952
Just leave!

06:51.536 --> 06:52.453
Go away!

06:52.537 --> 06:53.996
Who's this crazy…

06:57.500 --> 06:58.584
Mr. Han?

06:59.210 --> 07:00.545
Mr. Han?

07:02.839 --> 07:04.048
Hello.

07:04.882 --> 07:07.802
This is a no-parking zone.

07:07.885 --> 07:09.512
Seeing your car parked here

07:10.763 --> 07:11.931
made me upset.

07:13.474 --> 07:14.308
Goodbye!

07:16.686 --> 07:19.439
I mean, who gets that upset
over a parked car?

07:19.522 --> 07:20.940
An anger management issue?

07:22.733 --> 07:25.319
No, he has a cuteness management issue.

07:26.779 --> 07:28.614
- Gosh.
- What's going on?

07:39.750 --> 07:41.836
What is this? Are you kidding me?

07:41.919 --> 07:44.130
- You two are something.
- Seriously.

07:44.213 --> 07:46.132
I can't believe this.

07:46.215 --> 07:48.384
- Props to her.
- Same.

07:52.889 --> 07:55.558
Seriously, I'm so jealous.

08:01.731 --> 08:03.983
Ju-kyung, I was so worried about you.

08:04.066 --> 08:05.985
By the way, you were awesome earlier.

08:09.113 --> 08:11.991
- Good morning.
- Good morning, sir.

08:12.867 --> 08:13.993
Time for afternoon assembly.

08:14.076 --> 08:15.828
- Morning assembly.
- Morning assembly.

08:15.912 --> 08:17.413
If you say so.

08:18.372 --> 08:20.041
- What?
- Sorry?

08:21.542 --> 08:23.711
And please leave
if you're not in this class.

08:23.794 --> 08:25.630
Sir, that's Lim Ju-kyung.

08:25.713 --> 08:26.547
If you say so.

08:28.341 --> 08:29.175
Ju-kyung?

08:29.759 --> 08:31.677
- Yes?
- Are you Ju-kyung?

08:32.470 --> 08:33.304
Yes.

08:33.387 --> 08:34.222
Ju-kyung…

08:35.306 --> 08:36.807
Welcome back, Ju-kyung.

08:37.808 --> 08:38.935
I mean…

08:40.144 --> 08:41.354
I was just…

08:41.938 --> 08:43.147
I just…

08:44.524 --> 08:46.067
I was so worried about you.

08:49.654 --> 08:50.947
Don't cry.

08:51.447 --> 08:53.574
- Are you crying, sir?
- Why are you crying?

08:53.658 --> 08:55.785
- He's really crying.
- Don't cry, sir.

08:55.868 --> 08:57.537
Sorry about that, guys.

08:57.620 --> 08:59.163
Ju-kyung is finally back!

09:00.414 --> 09:05.127
- Don't cry!
- Don't cry!

09:06.295 --> 09:07.421
I'm really sorry.

09:08.172 --> 09:09.215
Ju-kyung… That's it.

09:10.675 --> 09:11.801
Don't cry!

09:21.686 --> 09:23.521
So you really came to school like that.

09:25.189 --> 09:26.107
Excuse me?

09:27.942 --> 09:30.444
It's like you're putting on a show
for the whole school.

09:34.240 --> 09:36.242
You wanted the attention that badly?

09:36.909 --> 09:38.703
I guess having Soo-ho by your side

09:38.786 --> 09:40.371
gave you some sort of courage?

09:42.373 --> 09:43.374
Hey, Su-jin!

09:47.003 --> 09:48.087
How could you?

09:48.170 --> 09:49.005
Su-ah…

09:49.505 --> 09:50.381
Su-jin,

09:51.591 --> 09:53.175
you're seriously the worst.

09:53.259 --> 09:56.345
You should be begging on your knees
for her forgiveness, but what?

09:56.429 --> 09:57.555
Is that all you can say?

09:57.638 --> 09:59.223
Why should I have to beg?

09:59.307 --> 10:02.602
It's you who posted the pictures
and videos on the anonymous forum!

10:04.186 --> 10:06.314
- Shouldn't we stop him?
- Where are they going?

10:06.397 --> 10:08.274
- Stop him.
- Me? I stop him?

10:08.357 --> 10:10.484
- What's wrong with him?
- I should stop him?

10:10.568 --> 10:11.819
Hey, where are you going?

10:11.902 --> 10:12.737
Lim Ju-kyung.

10:14.488 --> 10:16.282
You think you destroyed her, don't you?

10:19.952 --> 10:21.287
It's you who's destroyed.

10:29.879 --> 10:33.090
Sure, I tried to understand you at first.

10:33.174 --> 10:36.010
"Maybe she liked him too much
and did it in a fit of jealousy."

10:36.552 --> 10:38.471
"She'd be regretting it by now at least."

10:39.347 --> 10:41.307
"What with Ju-kyung
missing school and all,

10:41.390 --> 10:43.934
she must be feeling sorry
and worried about her by now."

10:44.018 --> 10:45.478
That's what I thought!

10:46.145 --> 10:46.979
That's why

10:47.605 --> 10:50.274
I was waiting for you
to apologize to Ju-kyung first!

10:51.192 --> 10:53.986
Instead, is this who you really are?

10:54.862 --> 10:55.696
Yes.

10:57.073 --> 10:58.449
It turns out this is who I am.

11:11.003 --> 11:12.046
Su-ah!

11:27.478 --> 11:28.604
Su-ah!

11:36.946 --> 11:37.780
Su-jin.

11:39.115 --> 11:41.367
Why are you taking things this far?

11:41.450 --> 11:43.035
Is something going on at home?

11:43.786 --> 11:45.413
Is it because of your dad?

11:45.496 --> 11:46.872
What do you care?

11:46.956 --> 11:49.333
I've been thinking
but I just can't figure it out.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.377
This isn't who you are.

11:53.337 --> 11:55.047
Is this what you really wanted?

11:57.174 --> 11:58.884
- Yes.
- I know it's not.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.886
I know you're regretting it.

12:00.970 --> 12:02.221
It's not too late.

12:03.097 --> 12:05.057
Just apologize to Ju-kyung.

12:05.141 --> 12:07.643
- Say you're sorry and…
- Stay out of this.

12:15.192 --> 12:16.277
Su-ah!

12:17.611 --> 12:18.988
Su-ah, wait!

12:21.907 --> 12:23.659
Hey, Su-ah, I'm sorry.

12:23.742 --> 12:24.577
Let go.

12:25.703 --> 12:28.914
I'm really sorry about not telling you.

12:29.874 --> 12:33.502
But I thought you might not want to
be my friend anymore if I did.

12:36.088 --> 12:37.214
Ju-kyung,

12:37.298 --> 12:39.508
what kind of person did you think I was?

12:39.592 --> 12:41.260
Was I ever your true best friend?

12:41.886 --> 12:44.263
That was all the more reason
why I couldn't tell you.

12:44.346 --> 12:46.432
But you told Su-jin about it.

12:46.515 --> 12:48.934
Gosh, you only told her everything

12:49.018 --> 12:50.644
and didn't tell me anything.

12:52.563 --> 12:54.940
You thought I would cut you off
if I saw your bare face?

12:56.275 --> 12:58.486
I may act childish,

12:59.403 --> 13:01.864
but how could you think so little of me?

13:05.159 --> 13:07.077
Su-ah, I'm sorry.

13:08.704 --> 13:11.916
After all I did to get you a boyfriend,

13:11.999 --> 13:14.418
you didn't tell me about
you dating Soo-ho.

13:14.502 --> 13:18.547
Your best friend shouldn't have to learn
you're dating from an anonymous forum.

13:19.215 --> 13:21.675
I'm really sorry, Su-ah.

13:34.104 --> 13:36.482
What do you think made her go that far?

13:36.565 --> 13:38.609
Nothing made her do it.

13:38.692 --> 13:40.819
She chose to do this herself.

13:41.862 --> 13:43.989
How could she do something like that?

13:46.742 --> 13:48.661
Su-jin is the one who left us.

13:49.495 --> 13:50.996
To her, you and I…

13:52.957 --> 13:54.542
only mattered this much.

14:01.423 --> 14:02.967
Let me see your face.

14:03.050 --> 14:05.302
What's so bad that you were hiding…

14:10.891 --> 14:12.518
You'd look prettier
if you worked on your skin.

14:12.601 --> 14:14.478
Go see a dermatologist,
get some treatments,

14:14.562 --> 14:16.689
drink a lot of water, and take vitamins.

14:16.772 --> 14:18.190
That's it. Don't worry.

14:20.484 --> 14:23.070
And you need to tell me
everything from the start, okay?

14:23.153 --> 14:24.530
When did you two start dating?

14:24.613 --> 14:26.240
Who confessed first? Is he good to you?

14:26.323 --> 14:29.743
That borderline sociopath
doesn't ever throw fits at you?

14:30.953 --> 14:32.872
- He doesn't do that.
- Don't grin like that!

14:32.955 --> 14:35.082
Tell me everything from start to finish!

14:35.165 --> 14:36.750
Be prepared to stay up all night!

14:38.627 --> 14:40.588
What did you mean by this?

14:40.671 --> 14:43.173
Hey, take that off! It's disgusting.

14:43.257 --> 14:45.092
Wasn't it a sign of your affection?

14:45.175 --> 14:46.427
What?

14:47.094 --> 14:48.387
This is the last time I'll ask.

14:49.138 --> 14:51.765
Haven't you warmed up to me even a little?

14:51.849 --> 14:53.058
No, not at all.

14:53.142 --> 14:54.727
Don't. Prove yourself.

14:55.603 --> 14:59.231
You really don't have feelings for me?
Then step on me as you cross.

15:01.483 --> 15:03.485
Wait. Think carefully.

15:03.569 --> 15:05.779
I said this will be the last time I ask--

15:20.669 --> 15:23.255
I have no intention
of foolishly remaining a friend

15:23.339 --> 15:25.716
and having a painful
one-sided love like you.

15:41.315 --> 15:42.316
Hey.

15:42.983 --> 15:43.817
Are you okay?

15:46.654 --> 15:47.488
Are you crying?

15:49.365 --> 15:51.867
- I didn't think it hit you that hard.
- Seo-jun.

15:53.035 --> 15:54.411
What do I do now?

15:57.665 --> 15:58.832
What do you mean?

16:00.542 --> 16:02.002
Did Go-un reject you?

16:02.086 --> 16:03.504
I really like her.

16:04.004 --> 16:06.256
But she doesn't feel the same way.

16:06.840 --> 16:09.718
I get flustered every time I see her
because she's so pretty.

16:09.802 --> 16:11.971
I can't just stay friends.

16:13.305 --> 16:14.306
Right.

16:14.390 --> 16:17.601
I would be really good to her
if she were to date me.

16:19.186 --> 16:20.354
I know.

16:20.437 --> 16:23.649
I didn't know how hard it was
to be in unrequited love.

16:28.362 --> 16:29.613
No one would have known.

16:31.407 --> 16:33.033
But there's this, you know.

16:33.117 --> 16:36.495
If you've given your all,
there are no regrets.

16:38.956 --> 16:41.834
Now that she's rejected me
after I properly told her how I felt,

16:41.917 --> 16:42.960
I think…

16:43.043 --> 16:45.879
I'll finally be able to move on.

16:57.141 --> 16:58.809
So when did you two start dating?

16:59.601 --> 17:01.145
It hasn't been that long…

17:01.228 --> 17:04.314
- Since the school trip.
- You've been together since then?

17:04.398 --> 17:05.691
How could you?

17:06.483 --> 17:07.484
Wait.

17:08.110 --> 17:09.987
A question from Channel Hyun-kyu.

17:10.070 --> 17:11.780
When was your first kiss?

17:12.281 --> 17:13.240
On the school trip--

17:14.283 --> 17:19.038
- You idiot, why would you ask that?
- Seriously, why would you?

17:19.121 --> 17:22.082
- Even I don't think that's right.
- You always disagree with me.

17:22.166 --> 17:25.294
"To make a flower bloom
on a swaying branch,

17:25.377 --> 17:28.255
how many challenges
did the snow have to face?"

17:29.757 --> 17:31.759
"Silently it must have tapped the branch."

17:33.135 --> 17:35.846
"Quietly it must have danced."

17:37.473 --> 17:39.975
"Sliding off the branch
a hundred times and more."

17:52.071 --> 17:54.656
"Look at the euphoric sight
that finally bloomed."

17:55.324 --> 17:58.952
"Every spring, where it was burned once,

17:59.036 --> 18:02.289
the branches burst open
the most beautiful scar in the world."

18:03.332 --> 18:04.750
"Where it was burned once,

18:05.667 --> 18:08.545
the branches burst open
the most beautiful scar in the world."

18:09.046 --> 18:10.172
How was it?

18:20.682 --> 18:21.725
Are you sleepy?

18:21.809 --> 18:24.645
Yes, I didn't sleep yesterday
and can't take it anymore.

18:24.728 --> 18:26.897
I'll be taking a nap in the music room.

18:26.980 --> 18:28.899
- You go have lunch.
- How could I?

18:28.982 --> 18:31.276
You go ahead.
I'll be right there with some snacks.

18:31.360 --> 18:32.778
No, it's okay…

20:35.150 --> 20:36.109
What is it?

20:37.486 --> 20:38.320
You're up.

20:38.987 --> 20:40.155
When did you get here?

20:40.656 --> 20:42.574
You woke me up.

20:43.867 --> 20:46.245
Gosh, you seem very tired,

20:46.328 --> 20:47.788
Soo-ho's cousin.

20:48.914 --> 20:49.998
Well,

20:50.082 --> 20:52.292
I wasn't trying to fool you.

20:52.376 --> 20:53.627
You weren't fooling anyone.

20:54.378 --> 20:56.546
It was obvious that you two were lying.

20:56.630 --> 20:59.258
What? You figured it out then?

21:03.845 --> 21:04.721
What?

21:05.806 --> 21:07.057
What are you going to say?

21:07.683 --> 21:09.559
With or without, you look about the same.

21:10.644 --> 21:12.479
What do they mean, they were fooled?

21:14.022 --> 21:15.440
I don't get it.

21:16.942 --> 21:18.110
Thanks for comforting me.

21:18.193 --> 21:19.611
I meant you look ugly either way.

21:20.946 --> 21:22.114
Are you making fun of me?

21:24.533 --> 21:28.287
By the way, I heard you helped
take down the video from the forum.

21:31.331 --> 21:32.332
Thank you.

21:33.875 --> 21:35.085
Don't mention it.

21:45.053 --> 21:47.472
You got matching items. I'm so jealous.

21:47.556 --> 21:49.266
I wish I had a girlfriend.

21:50.183 --> 21:52.436
Are you taking her out today?
Where are you going?

21:52.519 --> 21:54.521
Should I give you some tips
on decent places?

21:54.604 --> 21:55.814
I can do my own research.

21:56.732 --> 21:58.984
The information on the web
is all advertisements.

21:59.067 --> 22:02.612
They feature tons of places
that girls don't actually like.

22:02.696 --> 22:05.615
Our friend here doesn't have a clue
about dating, does he?

22:06.283 --> 22:07.242
Really?

22:09.244 --> 22:12.414
- Let me see what you've found.
- Yes, let's see.

22:16.376 --> 22:17.252
So?

22:20.505 --> 22:22.758
- I can see you tried.
- So he says. You did try.

22:23.425 --> 22:28.055
- Hold on! What's this?
- I like you so much, what do I do?

22:28.138 --> 22:31.558
I find you so pretty, what do I do?

22:31.641 --> 22:33.268
- Gosh!
- Hey!

22:34.352 --> 22:37.522
Such a charmer. So you've got a plan.

22:37.606 --> 22:40.984
- There's a softy behind this facade!
- So soft!

22:41.610 --> 22:44.154
- What do I do?
- What do I do?

22:44.237 --> 22:46.490
- Shut up.
- What do I do?

22:46.573 --> 22:48.450
- What do I do?
- Softy here is…

22:48.533 --> 22:49.618
- Bye.
- Ju-kyung!

22:49.701 --> 22:52.204
- Softy!
- What do I do?

22:52.287 --> 22:54.122
- Ju-kyung!
- Yes?

22:54.831 --> 22:57.417
I'm taking her today.

22:57.501 --> 22:59.169
Sorry, I'll call you later.

22:59.252 --> 23:01.088
Gosh, what are you going to do?

23:01.171 --> 23:02.214
- What do I do?
- What do I do?

23:02.297 --> 23:03.632
Should we take you out?

23:03.715 --> 23:05.550
- What do I do?
- What do I do?

23:05.634 --> 23:06.885
You should hang out with us

23:06.968 --> 23:09.429
- What do I do?
- What do I do?

23:13.683 --> 23:14.893
What do I do?

23:18.313 --> 23:20.649
Amazing!
They look so handsome on the cover.

23:20.732 --> 23:21.858
I love it.

23:21.942 --> 23:25.153
It's so cool.
This is Crash's first new album in ages.

23:25.237 --> 23:26.196
I'm so excited!

23:26.279 --> 23:28.323
By the way, I was caught off guard

23:28.406 --> 23:31.868
by your hardcore taste in music
compared to your cute appearance.

23:32.911 --> 23:34.454
We'll have two corn dogs, please.

23:34.538 --> 23:35.539
They look delicious.

23:36.373 --> 23:37.958
Thank you.

23:38.917 --> 23:39.876
Thank you.

23:40.627 --> 23:41.461
Let's go.

23:41.545 --> 23:44.214
- Let's see what's in Hye-min's backpack.
- Let's do that.

23:44.297 --> 23:46.133
- That hurts!
- "That hurts"?

23:46.216 --> 23:48.301
- Are you going to hurt her?
- No, I'll kill her.

23:49.719 --> 23:50.762
What's that?

23:50.846 --> 23:52.722
Are they taking a kid from our school?

24:00.230 --> 24:01.481
Limju, where are you going?

24:03.108 --> 24:05.819
- Hey, Ju-kyung!
- I'm starving.

24:05.902 --> 24:08.655
- Can I please have five corndogs?
- Ju-kyung!

24:13.326 --> 24:15.453
Five corn dogs and one tteokbokki, please.

24:20.876 --> 24:23.128
- Left foot, right foot.
- When are you leaving?

24:23.211 --> 24:24.546
Be quiet. After this round.

24:24.629 --> 24:26.756
Can you not interrupt this crucial moment?

24:28.216 --> 24:29.259
Come on!

24:31.386 --> 24:33.180
Let's see how much money Hye-min has.

24:34.723 --> 24:37.100
- What?
- You said you wouldn't come back.

24:37.184 --> 24:39.102
You said you'd let me go.

24:39.186 --> 24:42.981
That was for when you actually
found some dirt on Ju-kyung.

24:43.064 --> 24:46.318
But you didn't do a single thing,

24:46.401 --> 24:47.402
did you?

24:48.069 --> 24:49.362
Hey, Park Sam-mi!

24:57.370 --> 24:59.789
- Lim Ju-kyung?
- Hey, it's Dumpling!

25:00.999 --> 25:04.127
I've been meaning to pay you a visit,
and here we are.

25:05.212 --> 25:06.254
Let go of Hye-min.

25:08.340 --> 25:09.341
What if I don't?

25:11.176 --> 25:12.844
Hye-min, come here.

25:14.429 --> 25:15.889
Where do you think you're going?

25:16.765 --> 25:17.641
Ju-kyung.

25:19.476 --> 25:22.479
You're dating Soo-ho
and hanging out with Seo-jun.

25:22.562 --> 25:23.855
You've come up in the world.

25:25.148 --> 25:27.442
But I heard your videos and photos
are all over the forum.

25:30.111 --> 25:32.447
Your life is ruined, isn't it?
What can you do?

25:32.530 --> 25:34.491
It's not like you can be born again.

25:34.574 --> 25:35.533
Hey!

25:42.082 --> 25:43.917
What the…

25:44.668 --> 25:45.752
Are you crazy?

25:45.835 --> 25:48.713
- Do you want to die?
- You're the ones who are dying tonight.

25:52.092 --> 25:53.843
It's unfair you have a weapon!

25:54.469 --> 25:55.804
Hey!

25:57.097 --> 25:58.556
Does your mom know you're doing this?

25:58.640 --> 26:01.142
Leave my mom out of it! Cham, cham, cham!

26:01.226 --> 26:02.602
Head!

26:04.771 --> 26:06.481
I see that you've grown up.

26:08.733 --> 26:11.820
What's in that bag? That hurts!

26:12.737 --> 26:14.114
You sneaky little…

26:15.323 --> 26:16.825
You're dead meat!

26:27.419 --> 26:29.421
- Left, right. Jump!
- Yes.

26:33.675 --> 26:34.968
How dare you, Dumpling?

26:37.470 --> 26:38.638
Who do you think I am?

26:45.603 --> 26:46.521
Hey, hand it over.

26:47.981 --> 26:50.108
Are you challenging me?

26:50.191 --> 26:52.527
I'll accept your challenge.
Come and get it, Soo-ho.

27:06.708 --> 27:07.876
Hey! Nice!

27:15.508 --> 27:16.343
Soo-ho!

27:17.552 --> 27:19.429
You lose, Hyun-kyu!

27:19.512 --> 27:21.598
- Let go.
- Let go.

27:21.681 --> 27:22.974
- Let go!
- Let me go!

27:23.058 --> 27:25.977
- Hey!
- Let go!

27:26.061 --> 27:28.897
Who the heck are you? Get off each other!

27:32.025 --> 27:34.402
- Hey, let go.
- Why, you little…

27:39.074 --> 27:42.077
What sort of punks are putting their hands
on Saebom High students?

27:46.664 --> 27:49.751
Hey, I'll deal with these guys.
You should all just go.

28:00.261 --> 28:01.096
Hey,

28:02.097 --> 28:03.306
thank you, Ju-kyung.

28:03.390 --> 28:05.058
Don't ever follow them from now on.

28:05.141 --> 28:07.102
If they try to drag you, call the cops.

28:07.185 --> 28:08.561
- Okay?
- Okay.

28:08.645 --> 28:10.897
But Sam-mi doesn't scare me anymore.

28:10.980 --> 28:12.816
Turns out she's not very intimidating.

28:14.275 --> 28:16.444
Why was I so scared all this time?

28:16.528 --> 28:18.238
I should have fought back earlier.

28:18.822 --> 28:21.616
Right, I should have done that too.

28:25.703 --> 28:28.248
Jeez, I just got this today.

28:28.331 --> 28:29.541
What now?

28:30.208 --> 28:32.293
Boys, I'm sorry I couldn't protect you.

28:32.377 --> 28:33.878
It must have hurt a lot.

28:33.962 --> 28:35.922
- Oh no.
- I'm so sorry.

28:37.173 --> 28:38.508
Would you like to have this?

28:39.592 --> 28:41.302
I always buy two copies.

28:41.803 --> 28:44.305
Can I really have this?

28:44.389 --> 28:46.266
Thank you so much.

28:47.350 --> 28:48.977
I'll treat you to something yummy!

28:50.770 --> 28:54.441
By the way, are you also a Jelateen?

28:55.108 --> 28:58.361
- Yes, a third-generation Jelateen. You?
- Same here.

28:58.445 --> 29:00.989
- Really?
- Gosh, it's so nice to meet you!

29:01.656 --> 29:04.534
- Got tickets for the year-end concert?
- Yes, standing section A.

29:04.617 --> 29:06.703
- What? I'm also in the A section!
- Really?

29:06.786 --> 29:09.456
We could totally go together then!
This is amazing!

29:09.539 --> 29:11.040
Thank you so much for this!

29:12.333 --> 29:13.460
Glad I can help.

29:14.043 --> 29:15.462
What a pity this got ripped.

29:16.337 --> 29:19.048
The memories I never wanted to revisit.

29:20.884 --> 29:22.302
But something has changed.

29:23.136 --> 29:25.430
I'm not alone anymore.

29:37.025 --> 29:38.067
It's getting late.

29:40.278 --> 29:41.446
GIRLFRIEND

29:41.529 --> 29:43.323
Are you having fun?

29:43.406 --> 29:44.365
Did you have dinner?

29:45.033 --> 29:46.493
You're not answering my calls.

29:46.576 --> 29:47.786
I could come pick you up.

29:47.869 --> 29:48.912
It's getting late.

29:51.498 --> 29:53.124
- You're…
- Totally…

29:53.208 --> 29:54.459
tiresome.

29:57.045 --> 29:58.963
Why don't you eat
and not peek at my phone?

29:59.047 --> 30:02.425
Jeez, why can't you just let her
relieve some stress and have fun?

30:02.509 --> 30:04.886
Why bombard her with so many texts?

30:04.969 --> 30:07.096
She'll let you know
when she's heading home.

30:07.180 --> 30:08.807
He's obsessed. You're obsessed.

30:08.890 --> 30:10.975
- I'm just worried.
- I'm more worried about you.

30:11.643 --> 30:13.353
I was just like you in the beginning.

30:13.436 --> 30:16.523
I called her and texted her
every chance I got.

30:16.606 --> 30:19.984
She almost broke up with me within a week.

30:20.568 --> 30:24.614
She said I was making her get tired of me.

30:25.365 --> 30:26.199
What?

30:26.282 --> 30:27.951
Even if you totally love her,

30:28.034 --> 30:30.745
- you shouldn't be too available.
- "Don't be too available."

30:30.829 --> 30:33.915
So she won't get tired of you.

30:33.998 --> 30:35.166
"Won't get tired of you."

30:35.250 --> 30:37.293
You should take notes too.
What are you doing?

30:37.919 --> 30:39.587
- You should leave. Go!
- But…

30:39.671 --> 30:41.339
- Wait…
- We should finish the chicken.

30:47.512 --> 30:50.223
Tu-ah, are you having fun?

30:50.306 --> 30:52.225
I miss you so much!

30:53.810 --> 30:56.980
I'll be right there to pick you up, babe.

30:59.065 --> 31:00.900
Be available… No. Don't be tiresome.

31:04.612 --> 31:06.406
Soo-ho, I don't know much about dating,

31:06.489 --> 31:07.782
but if you ask me, I--

31:07.866 --> 31:08.783
Aren't you leaving?

31:11.452 --> 31:12.954
I'll finish this quickly.

31:35.018 --> 31:37.186
I should call Soo-ho.

32:14.140 --> 32:15.099
I shouldn't.

32:31.032 --> 32:32.617
Su-ah.

32:36.412 --> 32:38.790
Hey, why are you calling me at this hour?

32:38.873 --> 32:40.124
Send me a text right now.

32:40.208 --> 32:41.542
My phone must not be working.

32:41.626 --> 32:43.294
It's fine. It's working too well!

32:43.836 --> 32:46.422
Seriously, if it were broken,
you couldn't have called me.

32:46.506 --> 32:47.840
Seeing how she hasn't texted,

32:47.924 --> 32:50.802
- it's having problems with receiving--
- You're suffocating.

32:50.885 --> 32:52.679
Just go to bed. You're driving me nuts!

32:52.762 --> 32:53.596
Hey, Yoo Tae--

32:54.138 --> 32:55.515
Seriously.

32:56.683 --> 32:57.725
Yoo Tae-hoon!

33:12.573 --> 33:13.950
Is he still asleep?

33:21.958 --> 33:27.213
GIRLFRIEND

33:40.268 --> 33:43.855
I already cleaned the floor this morning.
You can just leave it.

33:43.938 --> 33:47.150
But you're always busy and tired,
so I wanted to help you out.

33:47.233 --> 33:49.027
- Is there anything I can help with?
- No.

33:49.110 --> 33:50.403
Come on.

33:51.070 --> 33:52.196
I could organize these.

33:52.280 --> 33:54.032
You're not helping! Just go home.

33:56.826 --> 33:58.870
Mom, the thing is…

34:00.079 --> 34:01.414
Hey, why don't you

34:02.248 --> 34:03.499
check under the chair?

34:04.834 --> 34:07.670
- What? Why?
- Just do it.

34:13.968 --> 34:14.886
What is…

34:19.432 --> 34:20.475
Mom!

34:20.558 --> 34:23.686
Turns out you have to study a lot.
There's even a practical exam.

34:23.770 --> 34:25.480
All that equipment must not be cheap.

34:25.563 --> 34:27.899
You can't afford all that
with just a part-time job.

34:27.982 --> 34:28.816
Then…

34:29.442 --> 34:32.737
Are you giving me your blessing
about my studying cosmetology?

34:32.820 --> 34:34.238
Quit your part-time job.

34:34.322 --> 34:36.657
You've made up your mind, so do it right,

34:36.741 --> 34:38.534
give it your all,

34:38.618 --> 34:41.913
and become famous like that girl Salad,
or Selena, whatever her name is.

34:41.996 --> 34:44.248
- Got it?
- Mom!

34:45.958 --> 34:47.877
You're grossing me out. Let me go!

34:47.960 --> 34:50.338
I'll really try my best.

34:51.214 --> 34:52.173
I love you, Mom.

34:52.882 --> 34:55.051
That tickles. Wait, I'm so ticklish.

34:55.134 --> 34:58.179
- Thank you.
- Let go of me.

34:58.262 --> 35:00.014
Hey, that tickles!

35:00.098 --> 35:01.891
- Stop! That's enough!
- Thank you.

35:02.683 --> 35:04.644
Lim Ju-kyung!

35:05.394 --> 35:07.188
- What?
- Why didn't you answer my calls yesterday?

35:07.271 --> 35:08.397
Why didn't you?

35:08.481 --> 35:11.067
I blew off some steam for a change.
Why must you be so controlling?

35:11.150 --> 35:12.360
All those calls and texts!

35:12.443 --> 35:13.820
I want to be free now.

35:17.115 --> 35:19.158
What do you mean?
Are you breaking up with me?

35:21.327 --> 35:23.788
You're so tiresome!

35:23.871 --> 35:25.331
What?

35:27.458 --> 35:30.920
I'm not tiresome at all.
What do you say? Ride with me?

35:31.587 --> 35:32.713
- Sure.
- Don't.

35:33.214 --> 35:34.632
Don't go with him.

35:35.550 --> 35:36.467
Lim Ju-kyung.

35:37.718 --> 35:38.594
Lim Ju-kyung!

35:41.681 --> 35:43.683
No!

35:50.273 --> 35:51.732
MISSED CALL
GIRLFRIEND

35:51.816 --> 35:53.651
What? She called me?

35:55.862 --> 35:57.363
Why did I have such a dream?

36:11.294 --> 36:13.087
GIRLFRIEND

36:17.216 --> 36:19.177
- Hello?
- Yesterday…

36:19.260 --> 36:21.053
When did you get home?
Why didn't you call?

36:21.137 --> 36:24.056
I'm not looking for an apology,
but you could've at least called.

36:24.140 --> 36:25.016
I waited all night.

36:25.099 --> 36:26.893
Now that I hear your voice, I miss you.

36:26.976 --> 36:29.103
So let's meet up.
I was about to go see you--

36:29.187 --> 36:30.855
- You're…
- Totally…

36:30.938 --> 36:32.064
tiresome.

36:33.816 --> 36:34.734
Where are you?

36:35.776 --> 36:38.279
My class is about to start.
I'll call you after.

36:38.362 --> 36:40.114
What? I…

36:47.997 --> 36:49.707
Hello, class.

36:49.790 --> 36:51.584
- Hello!
- Hello!

36:51.667 --> 36:55.546
Now, keep in mind
the volume of a human face.

36:56.589 --> 37:00.176
Apply the foundation thicker
in the protruding areas.

37:01.344 --> 37:04.639
As for where the skin is thin,
like near the eyes and the lips,

37:05.389 --> 37:08.476
you should apply a minimal amount
to avoid making the face look flat.

37:08.559 --> 37:10.770
- Yes.
- Why don't we practice on your partner?

37:10.853 --> 37:11.687
- Okay.
- Okay.

37:23.616 --> 37:25.201
Hello, I got a call earlier.

37:25.284 --> 37:26.118
Where is he?

37:26.702 --> 37:28.621
He's over there. He's totally out.

37:28.704 --> 37:30.331
- Goodness, thank you.
- No problem.

37:32.166 --> 37:33.042
Gosh.

37:34.710 --> 37:36.087
Jun-woo.

37:37.171 --> 37:39.131
Wake up. Grapefruit.

37:39.215 --> 37:40.883
Grapefruit!

37:42.426 --> 37:43.469
Did you call me?

37:47.848 --> 37:49.642
- It's my woman.
- What?

37:53.312 --> 37:54.897
Or maybe you're not anymore.

37:55.606 --> 37:56.524
We did break up.

37:56.607 --> 37:57.775
What?

38:01.862 --> 38:03.698
How can I make you mine?

38:04.282 --> 38:05.241
What?

38:09.120 --> 38:10.705
Don't you run away. Wait for me.

38:12.039 --> 38:14.834
After a year, you'll be mine again.

38:25.761 --> 38:26.846
This is too much.

38:27.513 --> 38:29.307
INSTANT NOODLES
BUY ONE, GET ONE

38:42.820 --> 38:44.822
- I got it first!
- But…

38:45.740 --> 38:46.574
Let go!

38:54.540 --> 38:56.208
- What?
- You first.

39:00.004 --> 39:01.339
Do I know him from somewhere?

39:02.965 --> 39:04.592
- Honey, try this one.
- Co…

39:04.675 --> 39:05.760
Co… come and open up!

39:05.843 --> 39:08.512
Columbus Park! Hold it right there!

39:09.055 --> 39:10.306
You bastard!

39:10.389 --> 39:11.974
- Columbus Park?
- Stop right there!

39:12.058 --> 39:14.143
Hold it! Hey, you!

39:14.935 --> 39:15.895
Wait.

39:16.979 --> 39:19.065
Right here. There you go.

39:19.148 --> 39:22.943
I miss Hee-kyung

39:23.027 --> 39:24.528
What do I do?

39:24.612 --> 39:27.073
What do you do? You should get in.

39:27.156 --> 39:28.491
There you go.

39:29.367 --> 39:33.329
You can't even last a day,
much less a year.

39:34.080 --> 39:36.582
- Stop right there!
- What the heck?

39:36.665 --> 39:39.752
Please help us catch him!

39:39.835 --> 39:40.836
Man.

39:49.345 --> 39:50.805
Goodness, thank you so much!

39:51.680 --> 39:53.641
Mom? Dad?

39:53.724 --> 39:54.767
Hee-kyung?

40:00.523 --> 40:01.857
Grapefruit!

40:10.241 --> 40:11.117
Soo-ho!

40:12.076 --> 40:13.285
You're pretty good.

40:13.953 --> 40:15.037
Hey.

40:18.165 --> 40:20.251
Why are you here on a weekend
instead of on a date?

40:20.334 --> 40:23.212
- Ju-kyung's been busy.
- Are you upset you didn't get to see her?

40:24.130 --> 40:25.131
I'm not upset.

40:25.214 --> 40:26.757
Why couldn't she make the time?

40:27.341 --> 40:29.802
She can't have gotten tired of
your handsome face yet.

40:29.885 --> 40:30.970
She's not.

40:31.929 --> 40:33.055
What are you doing here?

40:33.681 --> 40:35.433
I was just bored.

40:35.516 --> 40:37.768
But why come all the way here
to learn martial arts?

40:37.852 --> 40:39.353
You can learn it from me.

40:39.437 --> 40:40.479
What do you know?

40:40.563 --> 40:42.857
What's there to learn?
It is all about instinct.

40:42.940 --> 40:44.942
Instinct, my foot. It's about technique.

40:48.529 --> 40:49.989
You see that? Instinct.

40:50.072 --> 40:51.490
You may have great instincts,

40:51.574 --> 40:53.742
but you can't flip a person who's trained.

40:53.826 --> 40:55.369
- What if I do?
- What if you do?

40:55.453 --> 40:57.371
What's in it for me if I flip you?

40:58.205 --> 40:59.165
Are you that bored?

40:59.748 --> 41:01.208
Whoever flips the other wins.

41:01.292 --> 41:03.377
The loser grants the winner a wish.

41:03.461 --> 41:04.503
What do you say?

41:04.587 --> 41:06.422
You'll be left penniless.

41:06.505 --> 41:08.507
You should be worrying about yourself.

41:10.050 --> 41:12.052
No rules.
Count to three once on the ground.

41:12.636 --> 41:13.637
Sure.

41:49.048 --> 41:51.217
One, two,

41:51.300 --> 41:53.761
two and a quarter, two and a half.

41:53.844 --> 41:56.305
You're taking out your anger on me,
aren't you?

41:59.934 --> 42:00.768
Three.

42:06.148 --> 42:07.483
Couldn't you just let me win?

42:09.318 --> 42:10.152
Jeez.

42:10.986 --> 42:13.322
What do you say?
Do you want to train here too?

42:13.405 --> 42:14.406
No thanks.

42:14.490 --> 42:16.033
So what will you have me do?

42:17.034 --> 42:18.118
Just say it already.

42:23.123 --> 42:25.167
I don't love

42:25.251 --> 42:27.378
So obviously

42:40.933 --> 42:44.353
From far away, so far away

42:45.312 --> 42:48.190
I see you walking in

42:53.862 --> 42:58.242
How do I put my fluttering heart

42:59.368 --> 43:01.704
Into words

43:03.956 --> 43:05.249
You have

43:06.166 --> 43:10.879
Stolen my heart

43:10.963 --> 43:14.174
From the first moment

43:14.800 --> 43:21.515
You left me with an incurable disease

43:21.599 --> 43:24.727
I want to become a flowerpot

43:24.810 --> 43:28.522
This I always pray

43:28.606 --> 43:31.650
I'll become your flowerpot

43:31.734 --> 43:35.404
On your small windowsill

43:35.487 --> 43:38.449
Even if I can't say a word

43:38.532 --> 43:41.910
Though I couldn't ask for more

43:41.994 --> 43:45.456
I'd be graced me with your smile

43:45.539 --> 43:48.626
And your touch every now and then

43:48.709 --> 43:51.795
I'd get to see your sleeping face

43:52.504 --> 43:58.260
To my heart's content

44:02.306 --> 44:05.225
- Encore!
- You're so awesome!

44:05.309 --> 44:06.810
Here's the pizza you ordered.

44:06.894 --> 44:07.728
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

44:08.854 --> 44:11.023
I'm not going to make a bet
with you ever again.

44:12.107 --> 44:13.150
Were you hungry?

44:13.233 --> 44:16.236
I had a jiu-jitsu match and sang a song.
Of course, I'm hungry.

44:16.320 --> 44:17.321
By the way,

44:18.364 --> 44:20.157
your voice isn't what it used to be.

44:21.408 --> 44:24.578
- It's become deeper and more manly.
- That's my point.

44:25.329 --> 44:28.916
So why aren't you singing
with that deeper and more manly voice?

44:31.085 --> 44:32.044
It's too late now.

44:32.628 --> 44:34.588
- It's not.
- I don't want to.

44:39.927 --> 44:41.428
I want you to sing again.

44:44.515 --> 44:45.349
I know Se-yeon

44:45.974 --> 44:47.393
would want that too.

44:53.565 --> 44:55.692
What were you going to ask for
if you had won?

44:56.402 --> 44:58.737
- Do you want to know?
- Let me hear it.

45:01.323 --> 45:02.366
Can I tell Ju-kyung

45:03.367 --> 45:04.368
how I feel about her?

45:08.539 --> 45:10.332
I was going to ask for your permission.

45:10.999 --> 45:12.042
Tell her how you feel?

45:12.626 --> 45:13.460
Yes.

45:13.544 --> 45:15.629
I want to get rejected and get over her.

45:27.433 --> 45:28.976
From what he was saying,

45:29.768 --> 45:33.230
Mr. Won took all his money
and left him penniless.

45:33.772 --> 45:36.275
Would he still be in Korea
if he had money?

45:36.358 --> 45:38.068
He would have fled overseas long ago.

45:38.735 --> 45:39.653
Still.

45:39.736 --> 45:43.407
We turned him in,
so he'll pay for his actions.

45:43.490 --> 45:47.119
I thought I'd get everything back
if I caught him…

45:47.911 --> 45:48.996
I'm sorry, honey.

45:49.079 --> 45:49.913
Enough.

45:50.414 --> 45:53.208
Think of it as our fate
and something that couldn't be helped.

45:53.876 --> 45:57.880
Our moving here at least freed
Ju-kyung from those bullies.

45:58.464 --> 46:00.674
And Hee-kyung got to meet her other half.

46:00.757 --> 46:01.717
Isn't that right?

46:02.217 --> 46:03.177
She's right, Dad.

46:03.260 --> 46:05.012
Had Ju-kyung not transferred,

46:05.095 --> 46:07.097
I couldn't have met my grapefruit.

46:07.681 --> 46:08.682
By the way,

46:09.725 --> 46:11.560
when is Mr. Grapefruit going to wake up?

46:11.643 --> 46:12.895
Is he going to stay asleep?

46:24.740 --> 46:25.824
Were you waiting long?

46:26.575 --> 46:27.618
No.

46:28.911 --> 46:30.204
I should charge my phone.

46:31.413 --> 46:33.874
You ordered this? It looks good!

46:34.374 --> 46:36.001
I ordered it for myself.

46:38.295 --> 46:39.129
What's wrong?

46:39.671 --> 46:41.590
- Are you mad at me?
- No.

46:41.673 --> 46:43.258
- Are you upset?
- No.

46:43.800 --> 46:45.928
Do you think I'd get upset over nothing?

46:46.762 --> 46:48.514
He's obviously upset about something.

46:49.306 --> 46:50.140
I see.

46:51.517 --> 46:53.644
You don't seem pleased
about my being here.

46:54.353 --> 46:55.729
I better go then.

46:55.812 --> 46:56.730
Where are you going?

47:00.067 --> 47:00.943
Should I stay?

47:03.862 --> 47:06.907
Then what is it? Why are you upset?

47:09.785 --> 47:11.703
Are you really not going to tell me?

47:12.746 --> 47:15.249
Why? We haven't gone on a date
after making it official.

47:15.332 --> 47:17.668
I prepared everything,
but now you're busy and unreachable.

47:17.751 --> 47:19.419
Tae-hoon said I was being tiresome,

47:19.503 --> 47:21.171
and Seo-jun asked if he could
tell you how he felt.

47:21.255 --> 47:23.423
I'm dying inside from all the agony.

47:28.554 --> 47:30.013
- What is it?
- I love you.

47:32.391 --> 47:33.392
I love you, Ju-kyung.

47:34.601 --> 47:37.271
If you say that out of nowhere…

47:37.354 --> 47:38.313
What?

47:40.274 --> 47:41.775
You're giving me butterflies.

47:41.858 --> 47:44.278
How was your first class? Was it fun?

47:44.361 --> 47:47.781
Yes. It's a basic course,
but all the others seemed so professional.

47:47.864 --> 47:50.409
I'm the only person
who hasn't taken the written exam.

47:50.492 --> 47:52.536
I'll have to study hard
and pass it in one go.

47:52.619 --> 47:55.122
Do you want to go somewhere
after your written exam?

47:55.205 --> 47:57.249
- Where?
- Wherever you want.

48:00.419 --> 48:01.920
Why don't we go to the beach?

48:02.004 --> 48:04.381
We could take an early bus
and go see the winter ocean.

48:04.464 --> 48:06.466
Sure, let's do that.

48:08.969 --> 48:10.929
Can I please have this?

48:11.013 --> 48:11.930
It was for you--

48:12.431 --> 48:14.057
You were upset!

48:14.141 --> 48:17.185
Well, I meant to say we can share.

48:17.269 --> 48:19.021
You can have some and I can have some.

48:19.688 --> 48:21.148
You skipped tutoring again.

48:21.898 --> 48:24.109
Didn't you learn anything
from the last time?

48:24.860 --> 48:25.902
Are you rebelling?

48:25.986 --> 48:29.114
I'm asking you what your problem is!

48:31.533 --> 48:32.409
Give me your phone.

48:33.910 --> 48:34.786
Why?

48:34.870 --> 48:38.832
I need to see if it's your lowly friends
that are making you so absent-minded

48:38.915 --> 48:42.711
or if it's some boy you're seeing.

48:42.794 --> 48:45.631
- Hand your phone over.
- I won't.

48:45.714 --> 48:46.882
I said, hand it over!

48:50.927 --> 48:52.095
Are you out of your mind?

48:53.013 --> 48:53.847
Honey!

49:04.608 --> 49:06.109
- Did you get the table?
- Yes.

49:07.569 --> 49:08.612
I'm hungry.

49:10.572 --> 49:11.406
- Here.
- Good.

49:12.032 --> 49:13.450
- Dad, here's your rice.
- Thanks.

49:14.576 --> 49:16.870
- Please set the soup bowls.
- Sure.

49:17.371 --> 49:18.664
For Ju-kyung.

49:21.500 --> 49:22.834
Grapefruit, have breakfast.

49:25.837 --> 49:26.755
Here.

49:26.838 --> 49:27.964
Thank you.

49:28.048 --> 49:30.050
Hope you enjoy, Jun-woo.

49:30.550 --> 49:32.344
"Jun-woo"?

49:32.427 --> 49:35.597
Don't call him that.
She said he's called grapefruit.

49:35.681 --> 49:38.016
Father, I don't go by grapefruit.

49:38.100 --> 49:39.184
"Father"?

49:39.267 --> 49:41.353
Your cheeks are as red as a grapefruit.

49:43.188 --> 49:45.774
I don't need to call you Mr. Han
at home, right?

49:45.857 --> 49:46.692
Jun-woo.

49:47.192 --> 49:48.193
Don't push it.

49:48.694 --> 49:52.197
Why did you break up with her over me?
That just made me feel bad.

49:52.280 --> 49:55.075
Vacation starts today
and I'm moving up a grade, so it's fine.

49:55.158 --> 49:56.243
Ju-kyung,

49:56.952 --> 49:58.120
I'm so embarrassed.

49:58.203 --> 50:01.081
There's no need for that.
We'll be a family soon, Jun-woo.

50:04.251 --> 50:06.712
Hee-kyung, what's going on?

50:06.795 --> 50:09.089
What do you mean?
You're stuck with me now.

50:09.172 --> 50:10.340
There's the sleep.

50:13.135 --> 50:15.512
Let's eat! Eat, Grapefruit!

50:15.595 --> 50:17.139
- Thank you.
- Let's eat.

50:25.105 --> 50:26.606
- Really?
- That's crazy!

50:26.690 --> 50:27.524
What the heck?

50:41.288 --> 50:42.581
- Hey, she's here.
- Really?

50:43.331 --> 50:44.458
How could she do that?

50:46.376 --> 50:48.003
Gosh, she's a psychopath.

50:48.086 --> 50:51.631
Ju-kyung, did you get to check
the anonymous forum?

50:51.715 --> 50:52.632
The anonymous forum?

50:55.886 --> 50:57.971
- She didn't even check it?
- I feel bad for her.

50:59.181 --> 51:00.891
There're hundreds of comments.

51:00.974 --> 51:01.808
All about her.

51:01.892 --> 51:04.144
I'll tell you about what I heard
in the girls' restroom.

51:04.227 --> 51:06.396
Junior Kang Su-jin from class five
is super creepy.

51:06.480 --> 51:09.775
She's the one who submitted
Lim Ju-kyung's video and pictures.

51:09.858 --> 51:12.861
They were best friends, but when
Soo-ho and Ju-kyung started dating,

51:12.944 --> 51:14.571
she got super jealous
and betrayed her friend.

51:14.654 --> 51:15.697
I'm not making this up.

51:15.781 --> 51:18.950
I saw another friend
yelling at Su-jin about it myself.

51:19.034 --> 51:20.786
Just like a villain in a drama, right?

51:20.869 --> 51:24.122
Is she a psychopath or something?
She's a total backstabber for sure.

51:24.915 --> 51:26.750
Unbelievable. She went too far.

51:26.833 --> 51:28.668
How could she do that to a friend?

51:28.752 --> 51:30.128
Betraying a friend over a guy?

51:30.212 --> 51:32.672
She's the worst.
I never thought she was that mean.

51:33.507 --> 51:35.008
Don't you feel bad for Ju-kyung?

51:35.091 --> 51:36.426
- I do.
- I know.

51:39.387 --> 51:42.182
Did you take that picture
of Soo-ho and Ju-kyung in secret?

51:42.265 --> 51:44.684
Are you a stalker? That's really scary.

51:44.768 --> 51:47.521
How is Kang Su-jin going to
show her face at school?

51:47.604 --> 51:49.272
- Right?
- Practically impossible.

51:49.356 --> 51:50.732
- She's a criminal.
- Terrible.

51:50.816 --> 51:52.943
- She's troubled.
- That's totally crazy.

51:53.026 --> 51:54.152
Lim Ju-kyung.

51:54.236 --> 51:55.904
You think you destroyed her, don't you?

51:56.780 --> 51:58.073
It's you who's destroyed.

51:59.533 --> 52:02.702
- She's a serious stalker.
- What? She's leaving.

52:08.208 --> 52:09.543
That's ridiculous.

52:11.837 --> 52:12.963
Su-jin!

52:13.630 --> 52:14.589
Su-jin!

52:16.216 --> 52:17.133
Where are you going?

52:18.885 --> 52:20.178
Why are you running away?

52:25.684 --> 52:29.229
Do you still have nothing to say to me?

52:31.815 --> 52:33.066
You aren't sorry at all?

52:34.276 --> 52:36.653
No, I'm not sorry at all.

52:39.990 --> 52:40.991
Even so,

52:42.200 --> 52:44.286
I don't want things
to be like this between us.

52:46.580 --> 52:49.124
So I'm reaching out one last time.

52:49.833 --> 52:51.585
I don't want regrets later.

52:54.421 --> 52:56.923
Su-jin, let's not do this, please?

53:05.724 --> 53:07.475
Do you think I'd take your hand?

53:10.103 --> 53:13.523
Do you really believe
that we can go back to how we were?

53:26.244 --> 53:27.537
Ju-kyung, was it?

53:27.621 --> 53:29.164
Nice to meet you.

53:34.753 --> 53:35.587
Let's go!

54:52.122 --> 54:54.290
Eyeshadow, mascara.

55:00.338 --> 55:03.258
On the side of the eyes…

55:14.060 --> 55:17.480
NATIONAL MAKEUP ARTIST LICENSE
WRITTEN EXAM CENTER

55:22.569 --> 55:23.778
Did you do badly?

55:25.196 --> 55:27.741
It's okay, you can do better next time.

55:28.408 --> 55:29.617
I passed!

55:31.953 --> 55:32.787
Well done.

55:34.581 --> 55:36.833
- I passed.
- Great job.

55:36.916 --> 55:38.501
I guessed on one problem and got it right.

55:38.585 --> 55:40.503
- You were lucky.
- Yes.

55:41.296 --> 55:42.630
I can't breathe.

55:47.761 --> 55:50.305
Rise up, spirit of the tiger. Roar!

55:51.139 --> 55:52.265
Is this a recyclable?

55:56.186 --> 55:57.562
Whatever. I'm throwing it out.

56:09.616 --> 56:12.619
LIM JU-KYUNG

56:17.749 --> 56:19.918
You must feel lighter
now that the exam is over.

56:20.001 --> 56:21.336
I'm just getting started.

56:21.419 --> 56:23.505
I hear the written exam is nothing.

56:23.588 --> 56:25.882
I need to start studying
for the practical exam.

56:25.965 --> 56:27.634
It'll be harder to go on dates then.

56:28.468 --> 56:30.428
You should be studying too.

56:31.513 --> 56:33.973
Speaking of,
I don't see you studying much lately.

56:35.350 --> 56:37.477
I've been so distracted by you.

56:39.604 --> 56:40.688
Wait a minute.

56:43.650 --> 56:44.734
It's Seo-jun.

56:52.325 --> 56:53.243
Hello?

56:54.285 --> 56:56.162
Hey, are you done with your exam?

56:56.246 --> 56:58.331
I'm taking your call since it's over.

56:58.414 --> 56:59.707
Why? What's up?

57:01.376 --> 57:03.336
Can I see you right now?

57:04.337 --> 57:05.296
Right now?

57:07.423 --> 57:09.425
I'm with Soo-ho right now.
Can we both come?

57:10.093 --> 57:13.721
No. I need to see you alone.
I have to tell you something.

57:14.973 --> 57:16.933
Well, today is actually…

57:17.016 --> 57:19.269
Remember how you have to grant me a wish?

57:20.395 --> 57:21.980
I'll send you the location.

57:22.063 --> 57:22.939
See you there.

57:26.693 --> 57:27.610
Hey, Seo-jun.

57:29.070 --> 57:29.946
What was that?

57:30.029 --> 57:31.114
What did he say?

57:32.115 --> 57:34.868
He wants to meet to tell me something.

57:34.951 --> 57:36.453
I'll tell him we should postpone.

57:38.705 --> 57:39.831
Go.

57:41.416 --> 57:43.209
- What?
- Go meet him.

57:49.674 --> 57:50.717
Seo-jun!

57:52.469 --> 57:54.471
Why did you wait outside when it's cold?

57:55.180 --> 57:56.556
Your nose is red.

58:01.436 --> 58:03.229
What was so urgent?

58:13.740 --> 58:14.908
Let's go eat something.

58:28.671 --> 58:29.964
You're buying, okay?

58:30.673 --> 58:33.218
You're using your wish.
Why didn't you pick something better?

58:33.301 --> 58:35.386
- It's your favorite.
- It is.

58:35.470 --> 58:37.222
I could have this all week.

58:41.059 --> 58:42.852
So what did you want to tell me?

58:43.603 --> 58:45.772
You didn't ask to see me just for this,
did you?

58:47.982 --> 58:48.983
I need dating advice.

58:49.067 --> 58:50.985
What? Really?

58:53.863 --> 58:56.574
But what do I know about dating?

58:58.451 --> 59:01.079
Tell me then.
I'm not sure I'll be much help, though.

59:03.039 --> 59:05.291
- I like this girl.
- Okay.

59:07.877 --> 59:08.878
But I'm giving her up.

59:09.462 --> 59:11.881
Why? Have you told her how you feel?

59:11.965 --> 59:12.882
No.

59:13.466 --> 59:15.301
You're giving up without telling her?

59:16.135 --> 59:17.554
She has a boyfriend.

59:20.515 --> 59:22.976
Why did it have to be
someone with a boyfriend?

59:24.143 --> 59:25.353
Do you like her a lot?

59:25.937 --> 59:26.813
I do.

59:27.438 --> 59:28.273
A lot.

59:28.356 --> 59:29.857
Goodness.

59:31.150 --> 59:32.485
Steal her from her boyfriend.

59:34.904 --> 59:35.738
Should I?

59:36.698 --> 59:38.366
So who is it? Someone at our school?

59:39.576 --> 59:41.744
Not telling. It's a secret.

59:48.293 --> 59:49.210
Wait.

59:51.004 --> 59:51.838
Is it…

01:00:00.597 --> 01:00:01.598
Is it Su-ah?

01:00:02.807 --> 01:00:05.268
You can't steal her, you jerk.
What about Tae-hoon?

01:00:05.351 --> 01:00:07.770
No, it's not her.

01:00:08.730 --> 01:00:09.564
It's not?

01:00:11.733 --> 01:00:14.360
Then who could it be
that you're pining for her?

01:00:14.444 --> 01:00:15.987
She must be really pretty.

01:00:17.530 --> 01:00:18.364
Yes.

01:00:19.073 --> 01:00:19.907
She is.

01:00:21.075 --> 01:00:22.285
I have high standards.

01:00:23.036 --> 01:00:26.122
If she's that pretty,
you should have made a move sooner.

01:00:27.999 --> 01:00:28.833
If I had,

01:00:29.500 --> 01:00:30.877
do you think we'd be together?

01:00:31.961 --> 01:00:33.671
But what's the point now?

01:00:34.839 --> 01:00:38.051
There's nothing else I can do for you,
so I'll get you one more…

01:00:38.134 --> 01:00:38.968
No.

01:00:39.636 --> 01:00:41.721
I'll get you anything you want to eat.

01:00:41.804 --> 01:00:44.349
- Excuse me, can we get two more?
- Sure!

01:00:44.432 --> 01:00:46.059
She's so clueless.

01:00:47.310 --> 01:00:48.978
Want some fritters? Anything else?

01:01:18.800 --> 01:01:19.926
It smells good.

01:01:35.733 --> 01:01:39.404
Option one, option two, and option three.

01:01:41.030 --> 01:01:42.281
Which place do you like?

01:02:19.235 --> 01:02:20.820
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

01:02:21.696 --> 01:02:22.822
It was your hair, right?

01:02:23.448 --> 01:02:24.407
It looks very pretty.

01:02:25.324 --> 01:02:28.244
I called to let you know I'd be late,
but you didn't answer.

01:02:28.327 --> 01:02:29.996
I forgot and left my phone at home.

01:02:30.079 --> 01:02:32.415
What? Jeez.

01:02:34.208 --> 01:02:35.918
- Here.
- What is it?

01:02:37.170 --> 01:02:38.212
Wait, this is…

01:02:39.172 --> 01:02:40.089
Did you make this?

01:02:40.173 --> 01:02:42.925
Some girl asked me to.
She even gave me the yarn.

01:02:43.509 --> 01:02:45.887
I wasn't asking you to make it for me.

01:02:45.970 --> 01:02:48.765
I gave you all that
since it helps calm the mind.

01:02:48.848 --> 01:02:50.349
But it's pretty.

01:02:50.433 --> 01:02:52.101
Prettier than the ones from a store.

01:02:53.019 --> 01:02:54.103
Here.

01:02:58.316 --> 01:02:59.942
Put it around your neck like this.

01:03:00.693 --> 01:03:02.945
- How does it look?
- Pretty.

01:03:05.740 --> 01:03:07.116
The bus is here. Let's go.

01:03:32.058 --> 01:03:34.393
Feeding the sheep made me hungry.

01:03:35.019 --> 01:03:37.063
I heard your tummy
make a thundering sound.

01:03:37.146 --> 01:03:38.439
That was from the sheep.

01:03:39.106 --> 01:03:40.024
Right.

01:03:40.107 --> 01:03:42.151
I'm going to post the pictures
on Newstagram.

01:03:42.902 --> 01:03:45.822
NEW POST
#LOVESTAGRAM

01:03:47.865 --> 01:03:50.660
- Why are you only posting your picture?
- What?

01:03:51.536 --> 01:03:52.620
I thought you'd mind.

01:03:53.371 --> 01:03:54.455
I don't mind.

01:03:56.207 --> 01:03:57.333
I'll post you too, then.

01:04:00.294 --> 01:04:02.338
Lovestagram, couple's trip,

01:04:02.421 --> 01:04:05.299
boyfriend, healing, couple photo.

01:04:05.383 --> 01:04:06.342
It's uploaded.

01:04:08.010 --> 01:04:09.178
We look nice.

01:04:12.223 --> 01:04:15.101
- What do you want to eat?
- What should we have?

01:04:28.114 --> 01:04:30.533
Why are you laughing?
Did you draw me weirdly?

01:04:30.616 --> 01:04:31.534
Not at all.

01:04:31.617 --> 01:04:32.493
Let me see.

01:04:33.703 --> 01:04:35.496
Let's show each other at the same time.

01:04:35.580 --> 01:04:36.998
One, two, three!

01:04:45.089 --> 01:04:47.300
So you do have something
you're not good at.

01:04:48.384 --> 01:04:49.218
But it looks cute.

01:04:50.219 --> 01:04:51.304
Sure, it's pretty.

01:04:51.387 --> 01:04:52.722
Let me see mine.

01:04:53.389 --> 01:04:55.057
I did well, right?

01:04:55.641 --> 01:04:56.976
My nostrils are too…

01:04:57.059 --> 01:04:59.061
It's not finished yet.

01:05:00.313 --> 01:05:02.231
Hold on, I'll make them smaller.

01:05:13.618 --> 01:05:14.702
You're doing so well.

01:05:17.121 --> 01:05:18.080
Watch your step.

01:05:42.647 --> 01:05:44.106
I'm going to push it for real!

01:05:45.733 --> 01:05:47.568
- Are you having fun?
- Yes!

01:06:22.687 --> 01:06:24.563
Hi, it's been a while.

01:06:25.272 --> 01:06:28.651
- Sure, it's been a while.
- Hey, watch your language.

01:06:28.734 --> 01:06:29.819
You dropped the honorifics first.

01:06:29.902 --> 01:06:32.738
I heard you're Ju-kyung's friend.
I'm her older sister.

01:06:33.572 --> 01:06:35.408
Ms. Lim, you're Ju-kyung's older sister?

01:06:36.409 --> 01:06:37.660
Yes.

01:06:37.743 --> 01:06:40.162
Why do we have two beautiful guys here?

01:06:40.246 --> 01:06:41.831
Am I in heaven?

01:06:41.914 --> 01:06:42.915
No!

01:06:50.297 --> 01:06:51.924
You're that drunkard who went nuts?

01:06:52.967 --> 01:06:53.801
"Went nuts"?

01:06:54.760 --> 01:06:56.762
- You've seen me like that?
- What brings you here?

01:06:56.846 --> 01:06:58.889
Haven't you heard how you blew up?

01:06:59.473 --> 01:07:00.433
I blew up how?

01:07:01.225 --> 01:07:06.355
Didn't you know your video was trending
on Newstagram and NerTube? Look.

01:07:06.439 --> 01:07:10.067
Stolen my heart…

01:07:10.151 --> 01:07:12.111
- So what?
- What do you mean?

01:07:13.112 --> 01:07:14.822
You still won't train to be a singer?

01:07:15.364 --> 01:07:16.615
Will you just keep working here?

01:07:16.699 --> 01:07:18.701
I'll acknowledge it if this is your dream.

01:07:18.784 --> 01:07:20.828
But I heard you wanted to be a singer.

01:07:21.412 --> 01:07:24.874
Do you think I'll ever go back
to your company?

01:07:25.458 --> 01:07:26.459
Why not?

01:07:27.043 --> 01:07:29.295
You know we have
completely new management now.

01:07:29.879 --> 01:07:32.381
It's not the same company
you used to know.

01:07:34.091 --> 01:07:36.218
Why are you trying so hard
to get me on board?

01:07:39.805 --> 01:07:41.640
I have a good feeling about you.

01:07:41.724 --> 01:07:44.685
I saw your trainee videos
when I was looking for Leo.

01:07:45.728 --> 01:07:48.647
You should sing again. Please?

01:07:48.731 --> 01:07:50.316
I want you to sing again.

01:07:50.941 --> 01:07:53.652
I know Se-yeon would want that too.

01:08:00.284 --> 01:08:01.160
Hello?

01:08:01.243 --> 01:08:02.995
Seo-jun, are you with Soo-ho right now?

01:08:54.880 --> 01:08:55.881
Let's take pictures.

01:08:55.965 --> 01:08:56.799
- Pictures?
- Yes.

01:08:56.882 --> 01:08:58.467
I'll go get the phone. Wait here.

01:09:19.071 --> 01:09:24.076
I LOVE YOU, SOO-HO

01:09:26.287 --> 01:09:27.413
Ju-kyung!

01:09:29.832 --> 01:09:30.791
What did you write?

01:09:35.379 --> 01:09:37.464
- If you didn't see it, forget it.
- What was it?

01:09:37.548 --> 01:09:39.049
You know, some stuff.

01:09:41.218 --> 01:09:43.470
- Stand over there.
- Okay.

01:09:47.224 --> 01:09:48.934
I guess the battery ran out.

01:09:49.018 --> 01:09:50.853
Maybe we took too many pictures earlier.

01:09:52.062 --> 01:09:54.106
We won't get any pictures
at the beach then.

01:09:54.690 --> 01:09:56.942
- Want to come back later and take more?
- Sure.

01:09:57.026 --> 01:09:58.360
Let's go.

01:10:00.905 --> 01:10:03.490
- Let's go find a place to charge it.
- Are you warm now?

01:10:03.574 --> 01:10:06.035
Hey, Lee Soo-ho!

01:10:07.411 --> 01:10:08.746
Hey, Lee Soo-ho!

01:10:08.829 --> 01:10:10.956
The person you are trying to reach is…

01:10:11.040 --> 01:10:13.042
Why aren't either of them picking up?

01:10:15.044 --> 01:10:18.380
- Hey, Seo-jun. What's up?
- Are you with Su-ah?

01:10:19.298 --> 01:10:21.133
Ask her if Ju-kyung is with Soo-ho today.

01:10:23.010 --> 01:10:23.928
The beach?

01:10:27.806 --> 01:10:29.725
- It looks delicious.
- Let's eat.

01:10:34.980 --> 01:10:36.106
Have this too.

01:10:36.732 --> 01:10:37.775
It's delicious.

01:10:38.567 --> 01:10:39.860
I guess I have two stomachs.

01:10:39.944 --> 01:10:42.112
I had so much tteokbokki
with Seo-jun yesterday,

01:10:42.196 --> 01:10:43.322
but I can still eat today.

01:10:43.906 --> 01:10:45.741
- Did you have a nice talk?
- Yes.

01:10:46.825 --> 01:10:48.160
He asked for dating advice.

01:10:51.288 --> 01:10:52.122
Do you think…

01:10:52.831 --> 01:10:54.375
he has feelings for Su-ah?

01:10:56.710 --> 01:10:57.920
What?

01:10:58.003 --> 01:10:59.630
That would make things complicated.

01:11:00.673 --> 01:11:02.091
But he said it wasn't her.

01:11:03.676 --> 01:11:05.094
This one's fully cooked.

01:11:12.977 --> 01:11:13.936
Why are you laughing?

01:11:14.728 --> 01:11:16.188
I need a photo of this.

01:11:16.272 --> 01:11:18.107
Why? Do I have something on my face?

01:11:18.190 --> 01:11:19.024
Here.

01:11:26.532 --> 01:11:28.200
- All done.
- Did you put more on me?

01:11:29.076 --> 01:11:30.536
- Yes.
- Come on.

01:11:31.287 --> 01:11:33.247
Try the instant noodles. They're so good.

01:11:37.626 --> 01:11:38.877
Why aren't they picking up?

01:11:45.884 --> 01:11:46.719
Here.

01:11:48.262 --> 01:11:50.764
- Aren't you cold?
- I'm all right.

01:11:51.390 --> 01:11:52.975
Let's visit again when it's warm.

01:11:53.559 --> 01:11:55.602
Sure, let's do that.

01:11:57.980 --> 01:11:59.106
You know,

01:12:00.566 --> 01:12:04.445
what I wrote in the sand earlier…

01:12:06.071 --> 01:12:07.114
It was…

01:12:32.348 --> 01:12:33.932
Why did you close your eyes?

01:12:41.190 --> 01:12:42.983
That hurts!

01:12:43.067 --> 01:12:46.278
- I got sand in my eye.
- What were you thinking about?

01:12:46.862 --> 01:12:47.905
What?

01:12:47.988 --> 01:12:49.698
About the sand in my eye.

01:13:14.723 --> 01:13:16.975
- Watch your hand.
- Okay.

01:13:25.901 --> 01:13:26.985
It's pretty.

01:13:29.655 --> 01:13:31.824
Let's take a picture to remember this.

01:13:31.907 --> 01:13:34.076
Shall we?
I'll go see if the phone's charged.

01:13:35.369 --> 01:13:36.370
Wait here.

01:13:46.880 --> 01:13:47.923
Is it all charged?

01:13:50.259 --> 01:13:52.302
- Seo-jun!
- Where's Soo-ho?

01:13:53.053 --> 01:13:53.887
What?

01:13:57.850 --> 01:13:58.934
How did you know where we were?

01:14:00.686 --> 01:14:03.439
Hey, you should've brought your phone.

01:14:03.522 --> 01:14:04.773
What is it?

01:14:04.857 --> 01:14:05.732
Soo-ho.

01:14:16.493 --> 01:14:19.538
ACTOR LEE JU-HUN IN SURGERY
FOR BRAIN HEMORRHAGE IN THE STATES

01:15:00.913 --> 01:15:02.456
He'll be fine.

01:15:02.539 --> 01:15:03.373
Right.

01:15:04.208 --> 01:15:05.667
He'll be fine.

01:15:12.007 --> 01:15:14.551
Soo-ho, it's time for your flight.

01:15:34.321 --> 01:15:36.990
You head back. I should go upstairs.

01:15:39.243 --> 01:15:40.118
Seo-jun.

01:15:40.911 --> 01:15:43.539
Can you take Ju-kyung home for me?

01:15:45.791 --> 01:15:46.625
Don't worry.

01:15:54.508 --> 01:15:55.384
Soo-ho.

01:16:03.934 --> 01:16:05.477
Don't worry…

01:16:07.145 --> 01:16:08.647
and have a safe journey.

01:16:10.899 --> 01:16:11.900
I love you.

01:16:29.835 --> 01:16:31.211
I'll call you when I arrive.

01:16:35.507 --> 01:16:36.633
Bye.

01:17:17.299 --> 01:17:18.550
What do I do?

01:17:19.718 --> 01:17:21.470
What if he passes away?

01:17:23.555 --> 01:17:25.307
Poor Soo-ho.

01:18:30.914 --> 01:18:33.417
2 YEARS LATER

01:18:33.500 --> 01:18:36.420
- If you don't drink, you'll be in trouble.
- We get it.

01:18:36.503 --> 01:18:37.879
Hyun-kyu, you take the shot.

01:18:38.922 --> 01:18:40.382
Whatever!

01:18:41.466 --> 01:18:44.636
This is all useless.

01:18:45.470 --> 01:18:46.888
Ju-kyung's out.

01:18:46.972 --> 01:18:48.765
Hey, Limju, are you asleep?

01:18:48.849 --> 01:18:50.016
Limju!

01:18:50.100 --> 01:18:51.685
- Hey, is he coming?
- Yes.

01:18:51.768 --> 01:18:54.312
He should be here to take care of her.
Where is he?

01:18:56.690 --> 01:18:58.233
He's here. Hey, over here!

01:18:58.316 --> 01:19:01.027
- Hey, over here!
- Look at the time.

01:19:01.111 --> 01:19:05.157
- Come here already.
- Guys, who got her this drunk?

01:19:05.240 --> 01:19:06.742
- She did it to herself.
- Don't blame us.

01:19:06.825 --> 01:19:08.410
- It's unfair.
- She drank it herself.

01:19:09.327 --> 01:19:10.203
Ju-kyung.

01:19:10.287 --> 01:19:11.663
Ju-kyung!

01:19:11.747 --> 01:19:12.581
I'm here.

01:19:14.833 --> 01:19:16.293
- Wake up.
- What?

01:19:23.300 --> 01:19:25.135
- You're here.
- I am.

01:20:04.716 --> 01:20:06.176
It's snowing here.

01:20:08.136 --> 01:20:09.554
I hope the place you're in

01:20:09.638 --> 01:20:12.724
is not cold but warm.

01:20:12.808 --> 01:20:15.227
Don't wait for my calls anymore.

01:20:15.310 --> 01:20:16.645
Sleep well.

01:20:18.104 --> 01:20:20.065
One, two, three!

01:20:20.607 --> 01:20:22.484
You held back your feelings for two years…

01:20:22.567 --> 01:20:23.902
Whatever!

01:20:23.985 --> 01:20:25.403
- I'm not drunk.
- …then told her in a fit of anger.

01:20:25.487 --> 01:20:28.198
Shouldn't you know how I feel by now?

01:20:28.281 --> 01:20:29.950
Because I missed you.

01:20:30.033 --> 01:20:31.618
I didn't miss you.

01:20:33.995 --> 01:20:39.000
Subtitle translation by: Sun-young Ahn
